OL,3,GNEWSAPrice defends Welsh budget after
OL,4,Abusiness groups voice concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrice insisted ministers were "firing
OL,7,Fup the economy" and argued critics were
OL,8,Ffocusing on individual budget lines
OL,9,Frather than an overall increase in
OL,10,Fspending.
OL,12,FHe said the budget represented a first
OL,13,Fstep in a longer-term plan to reshape
OL,14,Fthe Welsh economy, including through a
OL,15,Fnew development agency.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
